@startuml
!include <archimate/Archimate>
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam padding 20
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title isac-chat-mobile – dátové vlastníctvo / ER hranica (ArchiMate, 2026-09-24)
legend right
  ArchiMate elements follow the repository reference archnodes.puml.
  Orthogonal lines and explicit layer/group separation prevent routes through elements.
  Source evidence is not runtime or customer acceptance evidence.
  Java 25 / Spring Boot 4.1.1 is the verified main baseline; exceptions remain explicit.
endlegend
Grouping(APPLICATION, "Application ownership") {
  Application_Component(MODULE, "Kotlin / Gradle Android client")
}
Grouping(DATA, "Application data objects") {
  Application_DataObject(CONTRACTS, "Contract schemas owned elsewhere")
}
Rel_Access(MODULE, CONTRACTS, "consumes / publishes")
note right of CONTRACTS
  No own business ER model is claimed in this repository.
  API/event schemas remain authoritative in the owning module.
end note
@enduml
